WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.264
In tutorial 8.4, you'll set
up weekly AI monitoring,

00:00:10.314 --> 00:00:13.015
so AI answers are measured
for you every week.

00:00:14.045 --> 00:00:18.400
First, open Website settings and
click the Tracking & monitors tab.

00:00:20.499 --> 00:00:25.074
Under Growth monitors, AI visibility
asks your buyer questions weekly,

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.778
on each assistant you tick.

00:00:27.812 --> 00:00:30.562
Next, choose how many questions to track.

00:00:30.612 --> 00:00:33.401
More questions give a fuller
picture of your market.

00:00:34.365 --> 00:00:38.140
Then add the buyer roles who
ask, and other markets to ask in,

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:40.238
like Saudi Arabia in English.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.590
Now tick Daily AI pulse.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.490
It asks your questions on the
fastest-moving assistants each morning,

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.118
for steadier figures and same-day alerts.

00:00:51.112 --> 00:00:54.397
Just below, you see the credits
this panel uses a month,

00:00:54.447 --> 00:00:56.569
and how precise its figures will be.

00:00:57.587 --> 00:01:01.462
Over fifty questions, you also
choose how the pulse picks them,

00:01:01.512 --> 00:01:04.147
and how many mornings a
week each one is asked.

00:01:05.462 --> 00:01:10.052
Next, tick Follow my keywords. When
you start a keyword or publish a page,

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:14.002
questions about it are added,
and topics you left are retired.

00:01:14.052 --> 00:01:16.915
Questions you added or
pinned never change.

00:01:17.899 --> 00:01:20.224
Then choose what the daily check asks:

00:01:20.274 --> 00:01:24.199
only the questions about the keywords
you work on, which costs less,

00:01:24.249 --> 00:01:26.055
or every question in your panel.

00:01:27.085 --> 00:01:28.610
On the Pipeline page,

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:32.210
Needs you tells you when your panel
is too small to cover a keyword,

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:36.646
and how many questions would. See
your AI questions opens your panel.

00:01:37.654 --> 00:01:41.054
Now tick AI growth, the weekly
work that gets you named,

00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:44.484
and choose how many AI answer
pages a month it suggests.

00:01:45.675 --> 00:01:50.369
Finally, check the credits each schedule
uses a month, and click Save monitors.

00:01:52.179 --> 00:01:56.604
Now AI answers are measured every
week, with a daily pulse in between,

00:01:56.654 --> 00:02:00.989
questions that follow your keywords,
and AI growth working to get you named.

00:02:01.998 --> 00:02:06.658
So, open Tracking & monitors, set
your questions, roles and markets,

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:11.168
turn on the pulse, let your questions
follow your keywords, turn on AI growth,

00:02:11.218 --> 00:02:12.070
and save.

00:02:13.044 --> 00:02:16.119
Your weekly AI monitoring is set. Next,

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:20.219
get named more often with
AI growth in tutorial 8.5.
